OL,3,GNEWSAParaders spend hundreds of hours
OL,4,Aon creations
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies, friends and first-timers have
OL,7,Fcome together for the one of Guernsey's
OL,8,Fbest-loved traditions.
OL,10,FEntrants have spent months building
OL,11,Fcolourful creations for the North Show
OL,12,Fand Battle of Flowers.
OL,14,FThe event traces its roots back to the
OL,15,Fearly 20th Century and has become a
OL,16,Fcelebration of creativity, community
OL,17,Fspirit and thousands of hand-made
OL,18,Fflowers, with competitors working late
OL,19,Finto the night to make sure their
OL,20,Ffloats are ready for the parade.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
