OL,3,GNEWSAParaders spend hundreds of hours
OL,4,Aon creations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong this year's entrants were
OL,7,FMichelle Roussel and Nick Ford who said
OL,8,Fthe float had taken about 325 to 350
OL,9,Fhours to complete and featured an
OL,10,Festimated 15,000 to 16,000 flowers.
